mail ([2:"reaper";1085316268;"castle";"hoho, menin NW towerii ja sitku tulin pois ni tulinki NE towerist ulos :D\nja iha persiist ettei tonne paase muita\n";0,6:"ahma";1085728653;"sculpture";"Okei tein tota paskaa veistosta joku viis tuntii. Se on nyt toiminnas\nja pistin koodinp鋞k鋘 noihin wroof/eroof ettjos ei tuu mokoa niin\ntoi veistos on siell\n/wizards/ahma/misc/sculpture.c\nKato l鋚i ja jos ei kelpaa ni poista se koodi. Vittu toi meni kyl\n鰒eriks. Ei saatana mitpaskaa.\n -Kaltsukka\n";0,1:"moonstar";1085253942;"Newssi";"Long ago when the world was born, the first humans builded the great city duranghom and lived there.\nWhen the time passed more humans and different races where seen walking in the streets of duranghom.\nIt was then when the first humans decided that they would abandon the city and seek a new place to live.\nThey traveled trough the plains,forests and swamps and finally founded a new place to live. \nThe city of Asgroth was born. They decided that the reason why they leaved duranghom was that\nthere where non human creatures around and they decided to seal their city from other races\nand they enchanted it so that no-one could see it.\nNow when the time has passed the gates of Asgroth has been opened for other races\nand the city can be seen again. The citizens of Asgroth provided duranghom with\nteleport room and now the two cities have been united again.\n";0,5:"reaper";1085516633;"toweris";"menin NE towerii, pari kerrosta luki descis et it seems that west tower isnt in use anymore mut sit lukiki ylemmas et it seems that east tower isnt any use anymore :O\ntiisit oks typoo tai jotai\n";0,0:"moonstar";1084953830;"Typo tsekata";"Jeesh elikknyt siinvaiheessa ettypo tsekataan noi jutut\nniin saadaan peliin heti kuhan walla saa hommansa loppuun.\nJos k鋠isit l鋚i ton /wizards/moonstar/areas/asgroth/ l鋚i ettei ole typoi\nja sileen. Pistvaikka joku typot.txt file sitten sinne niin korjaan ne.\n-Moonstar\n";0,4:"ahma";1085471237;"typoreport";"Nii ku Celtti ei haluais mit滗 tollasii ihme actionei noihin\ndesceihi. Kuten ku sulla siell on sellanen pieni tapahtuma\n-sarja kuvattu mite kivi tippuu maaha ja tulee p鰈ypilvi ja\nkaikkee. Mut must ne o hyvii ja luo tunnelmaa ja kokonaisuutta\nnoihi areoihi.\nSellast. Katon nyt noi loput roomit.\n";0,3:"ahma";1085428832;"typoreportit";"Joo tos on v鋒鋘 alkuu. Hiukan vielsettik鋣m鋞t Pidhauskaa =)\nTosin loistavia descej Tykk鋝in. V鋒mietitty etuk鋞eenki eik鋅nvaa pantu jotai menem滗. Tuollasiin meitsiki pyrkii. Siel on tosin\n\njotain sellasii juttui mist Celtti ei tykk滗 (desceis), mut must ne\noli hyvija ku teen itekki sellasii ni miks en antais niitte olla.\nOon v鋒kovis hei.\nMut korjaile jos jaksat jne.\n --Kaltsu\n";0,])
